[{:db/id "q-20461/selection/a5599a14c7ae177e493aff8d96d67c1146d2b63ac30495767101af730429f8ec" :answer/id #uuid "c89f6811-001c-5a38-8de8-4c9bbd39cc4a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & -\\frac{9}{2} \\\\ 0 & 1 & -\\frac{17}{2}\\end{aligned}],$\n$\\,x=-1$ and $y=-\\frac{17}{2}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20461/selection/4e0aad498efaea8c0cd247a0762a34ba9d56a8a21d8eb66445401f5db7fb46a8" :answer/id #uuid "6a70a0d3-8ddb-54a7-8514-e4a178778c25" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & -\\frac{9}{2} \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}],$\n$\\,x=-3$ and $y=\\frac{1}{2}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20461/selection/a7cca42034f1bc734e9781bde946a4ac3a27e5d24c0c522c8fd91c644f446fc9" :answer/id #uuid "4111a87e-2390-57eb-8123-0cc058bac377" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{17}{2}\\end{aligned}],$\n$\\,x=\\frac{4}{2}$ and $y=\\frac{15}{2}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20461/selection/ba43f1b72bd41a215d297954a1d698b199eabcf0e74af83dfd5893346c016252" :answer/id #uuid "aa7b35a4-185a-5914-8443-ac0fa4b3c6a1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{9}{2}\\end{aligned}],$\n$\\,x=\\frac{1}{2}$ and $y=-\\frac{9}{2}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20461/selection/5ce790f8751f04a68cc01808a4beeec66f26a7edcca648b0e4f6ef8fbb1164fd" :answer/id #uuid "d82abe34-4c80-5f15-abe1-f492d415aa81" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & \\frac{9}{2} \\\\ 0 & 1 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}],$\n$\\,x=3$ and $y=-\\frac{1}{2}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20461/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "8bffc7d6-a54a-5ece-bc0f-4c9cd4f413b1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-20461/selection/4e0aad498efaea8c0cd247a0762a34ba9d56a8a21d8eb66445401f5db7fb46a8" :answer-field/choices ["q-20461/selection/a5599a14c7ae177e493aff8d96d67c1146d2b63ac30495767101af730429f8ec" "q-20461/selection/4e0aad498efaea8c0cd247a0762a34ba9d56a8a21d8eb66445401f5db7fb46a8" "q-20461/selection/a7cca42034f1bc734e9781bde946a4ac3a27e5d24c0c522c8fd91c644f446fc9" "q-20461/selection/ba43f1b72bd41a215d297954a1d698b199eabcf0e74af83dfd5893346c016252" "q-20461/selection/5ce790f8751f04a68cc01808a4beeec66f26a7edcca648b0e4f6ef8fbb1164fd"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-20461" :question/id #uuid "0371d28b-41aa-5288-a97c-eeca95bd4c3f" :question/math-academy-id "q-20461" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -6 & -9 \\\\ 1 & -2 & -4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce $M$ to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system represented by the matrix." :question/worked-solution "Reducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}2 & -6 & -9 \\\\ 1 & -2 & -4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & -\\frac{9}{2} \\\\ 1 & -2 & -4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & -\\frac{9}{2} \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned} & x-3y=-\\frac{9}{2} \\\\  & y=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand we can apply back substitution. The final equation $y=\\frac{1}{2}$ tells us the value of $y.$ Substituting this value into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\nx-3(\\frac{1}{2})=-\\frac{9}{2}\\,⇒\\,x=-\\frac{9}{2}+\\frac{3}{2}=-3.\n$$\n\nThus, the solution is $x=-3$ and $y=\\frac{1}{2}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-20461/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a10cafc6-9da7-5ffc-a0c7-686a7638fbd9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-20461"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130910/selection/4ea2cd96d63e48cf4358941abeb3665e4a425dd426e7bc0dcb0dc0e22e323cf3" :answer/id #uuid "a07b071b-1df7-545e-9f12-03b5ebe08484" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}],$ $\\,x=12$ and $y=-2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130910/selection/429a3b05b741b18ddc776553ad0e9543fb54dc1cfb4bbd07a7af975dd977b339" :answer/id #uuid "0dc543b6-459a-5fcf-8011-b02a2730bbb9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}],$ $\\,x=15$ and $y=1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130910/selection/810a7342a872cc62aa9cea8eb1d9b8e90607b13be15d4bf4e88cd4203fb8dbb6" :answer/id #uuid "4b49eddc-f0db-5c41-9338-2b3ca8cdf682" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}],$ $\\,x=13$ and $y=-1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130910/selection/c376d9e8ed03fee4a9aae28db3b773712d58d46bdf48aaa69ff9781b05d1d664" :answer/id #uuid "ccf8fb30-5ac9-50da-a4bf-09f50dd3b3c0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}],$ $\\,x=12$ and $y=2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130910/selection/852de22733e009838483fa3b68133d73b96e55d034e955ebd4eb8171362d7047" :answer/id #uuid "783a60bc-1579-5f45-aecf-c05de1a26b75" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}],$ $\\,x=5$ and $y=-1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130910/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "791e5a06-2eba-5ca0-8882-261a36070737" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-130910/selection/852de22733e009838483fa3b68133d73b96e55d034e955ebd4eb8171362d7047" :answer-field/choices ["q-130910/selection/4ea2cd96d63e48cf4358941abeb3665e4a425dd426e7bc0dcb0dc0e22e323cf3" "q-130910/selection/429a3b05b741b18ddc776553ad0e9543fb54dc1cfb4bbd07a7af975dd977b339" "q-130910/selection/810a7342a872cc62aa9cea8eb1d9b8e90607b13be15d4bf4e88cd4203fb8dbb6" "q-130910/selection/c376d9e8ed03fee4a9aae28db3b773712d58d46bdf48aaa69ff9781b05d1d664" "q-130910/selection/852de22733e009838483fa3b68133d73b96e55d034e955ebd4eb8171362d7047"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-130910" :question/id #uuid "36655489-58cf-5b95-a28e-946cf05f7596" :question/math-academy-id "q-130910" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 10 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce $M$ to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system represented by the matrix." :question/worked-solution "Reducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 10 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -4 & 4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :=-\\frac{1}{4}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned} & x+7y=-2 \\\\  & y=-1,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand we can apply back substitution. The final equation $y=-1$ tells us the value of $y.$ Substituting this value into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\nx+7(-1)=-2\\,⇒\\,x=-2+7=5.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=5$ and $y=-1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-130910/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a10cafc6-9da7-5ffc-a0c7-686a7638fbd9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130910"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-1060/selection/14021477a2169a8401536a1ee518eaace12259fb149eb6507d9fd67d231d492c" :answer/id #uuid "b4c35b62-c01f-5354-8208-d5cec20a0def" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{15}{16}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1060/selection/041cee283217919e7167fc220098ae5e20cf9c475091a33266141db725965165" :answer/id #uuid "f7b8eba7-bf5b-584b-97e8-00c5e40e9ff7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{11}{16}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1060/selection/699d261f46d44feabdc9cb7f59b7518528ba94d322db9a44c6a333a88f6a0a77" :answer/id #uuid "a2d647a6-278c-5994-97ee-7870c8878ccd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{17}{16}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1060/selection/b37eeb175c7bf5e953b32c85acaf9f84f69c6d830d5b5c772caddfa6b193bf8a" :answer/id #uuid "497a9b0b-c34d-5915-9660-80e41049ff66" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{13}{16}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1060/selection/b89c32ffee3f5e13dd787bd0e02f2bf9e6f6197cdd3a368147d5fda24b97f0ad" :answer/id #uuid "fc38113a-0010-59ce-b64d-9837a0b810fa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{9}{16}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1060/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "70639cf9-3345-5368-8a0c-fe1ec47ac05e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-1060/selection/b37eeb175c7bf5e953b32c85acaf9f84f69c6d830d5b5c772caddfa6b193bf8a" :answer-field/choices ["q-1060/selection/14021477a2169a8401536a1ee518eaace12259fb149eb6507d9fd67d231d492c" "q-1060/selection/041cee283217919e7167fc220098ae5e20cf9c475091a33266141db725965165" "q-1060/selection/699d261f46d44feabdc9cb7f59b7518528ba94d322db9a44c6a333a88f6a0a77" "q-1060/selection/b37eeb175c7bf5e953b32c85acaf9f84f69c6d830d5b5c772caddfa6b193bf8a" "q-1060/selection/b89c32ffee3f5e13dd787bd0e02f2bf9e6f6197cdd3a368147d5fda24b97f0ad"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-1060" :question/id #uuid "b2cfb536-5e1c-504f-8c3c-31308e0bec9d" :question/math-academy-id "q-1060" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 6 & 8\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce $M$ to row echelon form." :question/worked-solution "Reducing $M$ to row echelon form using the standard algorithm for Gaussian elimination, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 6 & 8\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=-1\\cdot {R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 5 & 6 & 8\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-5\\cdot {R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 16 & 13\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :=\\frac{1}{16}\\cdot {R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{13}{16}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-1060/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a10cafc6-9da7-5ffc-a0c7-686a7638fbd9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-1060"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73544/selection/47b189542d12666ffa18564ec3b835ae4414d1a351b56a060ede6fe3fe2de27a" :answer/id #uuid "6ddfebc2-2d7b-520c-bc95-ae12624edae0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}],$\n$\\,x=1$ and $y=-1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73544/selection/aa413f3803576695d1ead630c08d9e9355218c22f027238a7b38d321a3652af4" :answer/id #uuid "258d1553-4f7f-5bd6-a78f-86ecb0a2ea1e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -4\\end{aligned}],$\n$\\,x=-5$ and $y=-4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73544/selection/7b562235649d85df86de904d0d3d48bf2ca35d373004618c0b10ed74d12d9b86" :answer/id #uuid "9543e6a4-01ee-57eb-ad08-af1a73145a7b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}],$\n$\\,x=-1$ and $y=-2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73544/selection/fd3e2308a3e21d892bb1aa7301fa2acd03bb9591be9edb11080a9df25994fe0d" :answer/id #uuid "7ddb2911-b415-5d95-950a-893ae03986c9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 4\\end{aligned}],$\n$\\,x=11$ and $y=4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73544/selection/c04e86659a9146a875bc1174a1df1a7354dd8c2ba8784ea9df35d460b2738ee8" :answer/id #uuid "cb134a7c-4374-51e5-807d-50a278d4ad87" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}],$\n$\\,x=7$ and $y=2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73544/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f6c329a7-7db1-5c67-8a32-902b842bfc96" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-73544/selection/7b562235649d85df86de904d0d3d48bf2ca35d373004618c0b10ed74d12d9b86" :answer-field/choices ["q-73544/selection/47b189542d12666ffa18564ec3b835ae4414d1a351b56a060ede6fe3fe2de27a" "q-73544/selection/aa413f3803576695d1ead630c08d9e9355218c22f027238a7b38d321a3652af4" "q-73544/selection/7b562235649d85df86de904d0d3d48bf2ca35d373004618c0b10ed74d12d9b86" "q-73544/selection/fd3e2308a3e21d892bb1aa7301fa2acd03bb9591be9edb11080a9df25994fe0d" "q-73544/selection/c04e86659a9146a875bc1174a1df1a7354dd8c2ba8784ea9df35d460b2738ee8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-73544" :question/id #uuid "4e51e1e1-f4ea-594e-af90-cfd7caef02c6" :question/math-academy-id "q-73544" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned} & 2x-4y=6 \\\\  & 4x-7y=10.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -4 & 6 \\\\ 4 & -7 & 10\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}2 & -4 & 6 \\\\ 4 & -7 & 10\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 4 & -7 & 10\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-4{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned} & x-2y=3 \\\\  & y=-2,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand we can apply back substitution. The final equation $y=-2$ tells us the value of $y.$ Substituting this value into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\nx-2(-2)=3\\,⇒\\,x=-1.\n$$\n\nThus, the solution is $x=-1$ and $y=-2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-73544/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "07abc1cc-5794-51a6-bad4-40565eae52be"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73544"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-20497/selection/c97ac12255983f5e6d3a15116ceaf75345dcd8ae8702d20070a6803586673806" :answer/id #uuid "3a673b7d-d277-5220-9745-5992f0992e76" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20497/selection/9dcf015d90cbea2d78b6636f69f60191b4ee0f78fac0b57e3a87ed70f6551ba0" :answer/id #uuid "f65d7876-5637-54ca-b6fb-7afb02938f03" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20497/selection/5f7c26e8c539814362a22abbeb62b2ea2764073b7c96f5c3ce66c69d8705526c" :answer/id #uuid "f8b782ec-afbf-53ea-9d7e-40ad527aea0a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20497/selection/3e7be4cd668eb46eda56ef61ba4886cd3425beca299bcd36de35de1f5dc144b1" :answer/id #uuid "e527e797-e39d-578d-bbbc-006ef1d0b4a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20497/selection/301a462d7615966d7333d8214902dbf22e1d95ec1e671af9b0d2cad70a45242e" :answer/id #uuid "2a66b23d-f2b7-5b5a-a485-c2924bff3dad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20497/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e0fa4221-2596-59c8-aef6-c18748848d9f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-20497/selection/3e7be4cd668eb46eda56ef61ba4886cd3425beca299bcd36de35de1f5dc144b1" :answer-field/choices ["q-20497/selection/c97ac12255983f5e6d3a15116ceaf75345dcd8ae8702d20070a6803586673806" "q-20497/selection/9dcf015d90cbea2d78b6636f69f60191b4ee0f78fac0b57e3a87ed70f6551ba0" "q-20497/selection/5f7c26e8c539814362a22abbeb62b2ea2764073b7c96f5c3ce66c69d8705526c" "q-20497/selection/3e7be4cd668eb46eda56ef61ba4886cd3425beca299bcd36de35de1f5dc144b1" "q-20497/selection/301a462d7615966d7333d8214902dbf22e1d95ec1e671af9b0d2cad70a45242e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-20497" :question/id #uuid "87c26d6c-3cf0-5b9b-ada3-9bbdd3c94fdc" :question/math-academy-id "q-20497" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned} & 3x+8y=22 \\\\  & 7x-5y=4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 8 & 22 \\\\ 7 & -5 & 4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}3 & 8 & 22 \\\\ 7 & -5 & 4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 7 & -5 & 4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-7{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 0 & -\\frac{71}{3} & -\\frac{142}{3}\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :=-\\frac{3}{71}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{8}{3} & \\frac{22}{3} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-20497/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "07abc1cc-5794-51a6-bad4-40565eae52be"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-20497"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-20500/selection/05d5745d6e5e678c8f49e36f5f3008a631fddae5e0aa16e46471face293759d8" :answer/id #uuid "576f81c5-c3f4-57d4-9f4e-e3d74b15ed79" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}],$\n$\\,x=11$ and $y=0$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20500/selection/eeae79503eb8f0b7726e045a6e5a3d62a46c86e5cd5d30de74657a1b074d1c4e" :answer/id #uuid "6b48d3af-73c0-5028-a73c-6675071dda87" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 6\\end{aligned}],$\n$\\,x=9$ and $y=6$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20500/selection/4b1a32467004f0e76bb38233785d9de6933a1cea2e3f5fe729cd56ff881fa24e" :answer/id #uuid "bf371e18-f936-5f34-9444-6370fd8e8311" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3\\end{aligned}],$\n$\\,x=12$ and $y=-3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20500/selection/beb87e060516382ea67fd3ccdf3ab44e071cdc667e900bb29d44fea98f27cffc" :answer/id #uuid "42b4f57d-b9f8-5f89-95c5-b3ed07cb485c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 30\\end{aligned}],$\n$\\,x=1$ and $y=30$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20500/selection/ecc47a50bd1cd8d9336fd284b279939bccd8a682527547b62ae8f71c7ec571ed" :answer/id #uuid "dd61b1bc-149a-5ed2-b7ba-83b8912a5cb1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$M∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}],$\n$\\,x=10$ and $y=3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-20500/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "2a565768-4632-5861-9fb8-28453cf31453" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-20500/selection/beb87e060516382ea67fd3ccdf3ab44e071cdc667e900bb29d44fea98f27cffc" :answer-field/choices ["q-20500/selection/05d5745d6e5e678c8f49e36f5f3008a631fddae5e0aa16e46471face293759d8" "q-20500/selection/eeae79503eb8f0b7726e045a6e5a3d62a46c86e5cd5d30de74657a1b074d1c4e" "q-20500/selection/4b1a32467004f0e76bb38233785d9de6933a1cea2e3f5fe729cd56ff881fa24e" "q-20500/selection/beb87e060516382ea67fd3ccdf3ab44e071cdc667e900bb29d44fea98f27cffc" "q-20500/selection/ecc47a50bd1cd8d9336fd284b279939bccd8a682527547b62ae8f71c7ec571ed"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-20500" :question/id #uuid "f0075587-5999-58f6-a70b-eea8bfd44ed3" :question/math-academy-id "q-20500" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned} & x+\\frac{1}{3}y=11 \\\\  & 3x+\\frac{1}{5}y=9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 3 & \\frac{1}{5} & 9\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 3 & \\frac{1}{5} & 9\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 0 & -\\frac{4}{5} & -24\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :=-\\frac{5}{4}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & \\frac{1}{3} & 11 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 30\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned} & x+\\frac{1}{3}y=11 \\\\  & y=30,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand we can apply back substitution. The final equation $y=30$ tells us the value of $y.$ Substituting this value into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\nx+\\frac{1}{3}(30)=11\\,⇒\\,x=11-10=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=1$ and $y=30.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-20500/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "07abc1cc-5794-51a6-bad4-40565eae52be"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-20500"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-4697"] :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by \n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071933/assets/67d01790cfbda1f20a23c9e22a64714156485851ce56b2f73e9873db6ef4bed8.png)\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce $M$ to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system represented by the matrix." :question/worked-solution "Reducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2 & -8\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -8 & -8\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :=-\\frac{1}{8}{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071933/assets/da9c44be043ad3a15808a9e0dd77636697170047e61b73a0d591bc3581d992fb.png)\n\nand we can apply back substitution. The final equation $y=1$ tells us the value of $y.$ Substituting this value into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\nx+2(1)=0 \n\t\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad\n\tx=-2.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=-2$ and $y=1.$ Or, in vector form, $\\left<  -2,1 \\right>.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-4698"] :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071933/assets/a80ecf94bbd4f0ea4b7a860e340039ca80bc5ccd0d2a19503cb9dcc571558976.png)\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system." :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071933/assets/ab29f353f00454b6e8eeb490336e2b33d0b2cf6cd47f4d24ac6c8a8f042af628.png)\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 5 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -6 & 5\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=-{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 & -5 \\\\ 1 & -6 & 5\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 & -5 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 10\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :=-{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -5 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -10\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071933/assets/ee5b759f55931cf4935a0763f22c9eb5deedb04f3e247c295aa2a1da09b121b4.png)\n\nand we can apply back substitution. The final equation $y=-10$ tells us the value of $y.$ Substituting this value into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\nx-5(-10)=-5 \n\t\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad\n\tx=-55.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=-55$ and $y=-10.$ Or, in vector form, $\\langle -55,-10 \\rangle.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]}]
